==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2.67~14 seconds<sup>80f~420f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~18 seconds<sup>100f~540f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60~63.33 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,900f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Pigge]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 4~10 seconds<sup>120f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 4.67~14 seconds<sup>140f~420f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

